          <placeName type="preferred">Mazhuvendinathar temple </placeName>
          <desc type="function">Temple</desc>
          <note type="coordinates">10.9661878, 79.3432443</note>
          <note type="general">Śaiva temple located in the north-east corner of Babhurajapuram. There used to be two agrahāras linked to it: the South agrahāra and the East one. There have been recent developments in the East agrahāra but the South has kept more of its traditional features.</note>
